      "description_zh": "持续施法 - 使用生命汲取时，帕格纳吸取目标敌方单位的生命值，并获得其视野。\n\n向队友施放可以将自己的生命值转移给队友。",
      "description_en": "CHANNELED - When cast on an enemy, Pugna drains health from the target enemy unit to heal himself and granting vision over the target.\n\nWhen cast on an ally, Pugna will drain his own health into his ally.",
      "notes_zh": [],
      "notes_en": [],
      "source_collection": "abilities",
      "source_pointer": "/result/data/heroes/0/abilities/4",
      "innate": false,
      "granted_by_scepter": false,
      "granted_by_shard": false,
      "upgrade_text": {
        "scepter_loc": {
          "en": "Reduces cooldown by %abilitycooldown%s. When targeting an enemy hero, Pugna reduces their outgoing spell damage by %spell_amp_drain_rate%%% per second up to a maximum of %spell_amp_drain_max%%% and increases his own, up to a maximum of %max_spell_amp_drain_pct%%%. When draining through a Nether Ward using Shard, the rate of increase/decrease is %spell_amp_drain_rate_ward%%% instead. Debuff lasts %spell_amp_drain_duration% seconds.",
          "zh": "冷却时间减少%abilitycooldown%秒。以敌方英雄为目标时，帕格纳每秒降低他们%spell_amp_drain_rate%%%技能伤害输出，最高可达到%spell_amp_drain_max%%%，并且自身的技能伤害输出提升，最高可达到%max_spell_amp_drain_pct%%%。魔晶升级下对幽冥守卫施放时降低和提升的速率为%spell_amp_drain_rate_ward%%%。负面效果持续%spell_amp_drain_duration%秒。"
        },
        "shard_loc": {
          "en": "Life Drain can target your Nether Ward, causing life drain to refract to all enemy heroes within %abilitycastrange% units of the ward for %shard_damage_pct_from_ward%%% of its normal value. The effect is interrupted if the ward is destroyed.",
          "zh": "生命汲取可以对幽冥守卫施放，使生命汲取可以折射至守卫附近%abilitycastrange%范围内所有敌方英雄，造成%shard_damage_pct_from_ward%%%效果。守卫被摧毁后效果将会中断。"
        }
      },
